<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<p><ul>
<h4>Direct access to online <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/" target="_blank">help</a>: <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/msa/HDFIMG.htm" target="_blank"><font size="+2">HDFIMG</font></a></h4>
<h4>Access the application from the menu: <i>"File | Import | Rasters | HDF (ASTER, MODIS, NASAOcean[SeaWiFS, CTS, CZCS], PrOBA-CHRIS) -> IMG"</i></h4>
</ul></p>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

